    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Dropped packets",
      "description": "On the way to peers: peer_offline (the peer is not connected), stream_error (opening or writing the stream failed), unknown_address (no peer has this awl address), gateway_client_disabled (a packet to the internet with the gateway client off: from an app bound to every interface, such as a torrent client, or from routes that do not match the tunnel), outbound_channel_full and gateway_channel_full (the queue to a peer, 2000 packets, is full: the link to it is the bottleneck). From peers: inbound_channel_full, parse_error, ipv6_disabled (IPv6 is off on this node or for the sender) and the gateway_* refusals. Both ways: tunneling_disabled (VPN traffic with the peer is turned off).",
      "id": 4,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
